          "type": "Int"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "TArray<FVec3>",
      "docs": "Returns sample points centered about the origin.\n\\p NumPoints specifies how many points to generate.\n\\p IncludeEndCaps determines whether or not points are generated on the\nend caps of the capsule."
    },
    {
